<title>USA: Safeco Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Safeco Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>SEATTLE, Oct 28 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			 Sept 30, 1996	     Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $	0.92	    $	0.91</p>
<p> Net		    115,986		    114,857</p>
<p> Revs		 1,042,787		  1,000,756</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $	2.64	    $	2.25</p>
<p> Net		     332,672		   282,766</p>
<p> Revs		  3,054,647		 2,938,769</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE:1996 nine months and Q3 nets include gains from investments of $45.4 million and $10.8 million, respectively.</p>
<p>1995 nine months and Q3 nets include gains from investments of $27.9 million and $14.0 million, respecitvely.</p>
<p>Prior year amounts are adjusted to reflect the December 1995 2-for-1 stock split.</p>
</text>
